# Debian Installer's current trixie image uses the 6.12.107 ABI. Its live
# installer launcher rejects a live kernel with a different ABI. Keep the
# build-time kernel metapackages aligned while security remains enabled for
# all other packages. build-iso.sh fails if Debian Installer changes ABI.
Package: linux-image-amd64 linux-headers-amd64
Pin: version 6.12.107-1
Pin-Priority: 1001
